Upstream license declaration
============================

The supplied 0.4.6 source resources/META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml
declares license="MIT". Neither that source folder nor its pinned production
JAR includes a copyright notice or complete license text. This file records
the supplied declaration; it does not invent a copyright holder or replace
an upstream notice. The production JAR and source/resources are unchanged.
See provenance.json and docs/SOURCE_AUDIT.md for the exact input hashes.
